### Requisicoes de exemplo (extensao REST Client do VS Code ou HTTP files do Visual Studio)

@lanc = http://localhost:5101
@cons = http://localhost:5102

### 1) Obter token
# @name login
POST {{lanc}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usuario": "comerciante", "senha": "senha123" }

### 2) Registrar um credito
POST {{lanc}}/api/lancamentos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tipo": "Credito", "valor": 250.00, "descricao": "Venda no balcao" }

### 3) Registrar um debito
POST {{lanc}}/api/lancamentos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tipo": "Debito", "valor": 90.00, "descricao": "Pagamento de fornecedor" }

### 4) Listar lancamentos do dia (troque a data)
GET {{lanc}}/api/lancamentos?data=2026-10-26
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5) Consolidado diario (troque a data)
GET {{cons}}/api/consolidado/2026-10-26
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 6) Health checks
GET {{lanc}}/health

###
GET {{cons}}/health
